        "doc": "The response headers, on every response including errors.\n\nA nonce-based CSP with no unsafe-inline is what makes the XSS mitigation\nstructural: even a successful injection into the analyst workspace has no\nway to execute.",
        "isAsync": false,
        "name": "security_headers",
        "params": [
          {
            "name": "nonce",
            "type": "string"
