        "capabilities": [],
        "code": "return {\n    \"Content-Security-Policy\": (\n        \"default-src 'self'; \"\n        \"script-src 'self' 'nonce-%s'; \" % nonce +\n        \"style-src 'self' 'nonce-%s'; \" % nonce +\n        \"img-src 'self' data:; \"\n        \"connect-src 'self'; \"\n        \"frame-src 'self'; \"\n        \"frame-ancestors 'none'; \"\n        \"object-src 'none'; \"\n        \"base-uri 'none'; \"\n        \"form-action 'self'\"\n    ),\n    \"Strict-Transport-Security\": \"max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains\",\n    \"X-Content-Type-Options\": \"nosniff\",\n    \"Referrer-Policy\": \"no-referrer\",\n    \"Permissions-Policy\": \"geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=()\",\n    \"Cache-Control\": \"no-store\",\n    \"Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy\": \"same-origin\",\n    \"Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy\": \"same-origin\",\n}",
        "doc": "The response headers, on every response including errors.\n\nA nonce-based CSP with no unsafe-inline is what makes the XSS mitigation\nstructural: even a successful injection into the analyst workspace has no\nway to execute.",
